WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:06.740
♪♪

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.674
-Is this thing busted
or something?

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:09.809
It's taking forever.

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:11.411
-Girl, I know Biden
better do something

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:12.979
about these gas prices.

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.346
-I know, right?
$6 a gallon?

00:00:14.346 --> 00:00:15.748
What are they using, Casamigos?

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:16.983
[ Both laugh ]

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:18.251
-Excuse me.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:20.987
You know, I ain't trying
to bother y'all,

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:22.955
but y'all looking very beautiful
tonight.

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:24.624
-Oh, boy.
-Here we go.

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:26.692
-I just want to know if I can
get your number or something.

00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:27.893
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:27.893 --> 00:00:29.562
-No.
-No.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:32.131
-Damn, saying no, can't I at
least talk to you for a second?

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:33.400
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.868
-Uh, you got a hole
in your jacket.

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.570
-So what, though?

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.873
What, you got a man,
or something like that?

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.541
-Yep.
-I'm married.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.175
-So what, though?

00:00:43.175 --> 00:00:45.011
That mean I can't get
to know you?

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:46.579
-You got bags on your feet.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:49.348
-So what, though?
That mean I can't talk to you?

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:51.751
-Talk about what?
-Do you work here or something?

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:53.252
-No, I ain't got no job.

00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:54.654
But I get money, though.

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:57.023
-By collecting cans?

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:58.691
-Don't worry about all that.

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.793
I'm saying, girl, can I get
your phone number or something?

00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:03.462
-I think your car is on fire.
-What's that even mean?

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:07.099
-She means your car is literally
on fire right now.

00:01:07.099 --> 00:01:08.968
-So what, though?

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:12.071
I'm just saying, baby,
I can't know your name?

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:13.840
-Is that your baby?
-Is what my baby?

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.042
-The baby in the stroller
rolling into the street.

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:17.577
[ Horn honking ]

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:18.978
-Yeah, I guess that's my baby.

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:20.513
Why y'all can't
answer my questions, though?

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:22.048
That's what I want to know.

00:01:22.048 --> 00:01:23.850
-Oh, my God,
what is your question?

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:26.085
-I'm saying, can I have
your home address?

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:27.854
-No!

00:01:27.854 --> 00:01:30.456
-Ooh!

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:33.626
What do we have here?

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.962
-Oh, God.
Would this pump hurry up? Damn.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:38.364
-Do my eyes deceive me,

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:42.235
or am I looking at
my future ex-baby mama?

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:45.004
-"Ex-baby mama"?
And how would that happen?

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:47.873
-I'm saying, though,
what's your name, baby girl?

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:51.478
-Dude, are you
peeing on yourself right now?

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:54.346
-Look, man, I'm just trying
to get to know you, baby girl.

00:01:54.346 --> 00:01:55.748
-This my homie.

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:57.483
We're not trying to bother
y'all.

00:01:57.483 --> 00:01:59.485
-Yeah, we just want to know
your sign.

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:01.888
Are you a Virgo
or a "Sagittaricruz"?

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:04.156
-What happened to your teeth?
-My what?

00:02:04.156 --> 00:02:05.491
-Are you wearing
a hospital gown?

00:02:05.491 --> 00:02:08.261
-I might be.
You going to nurse me?

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:09.695
-Ooh!

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:11.430
-Oh, my God, why is this pump
taking so long?

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:12.899
-Girl, when are you going to let
me take you out

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:14.900
to Harry Potter World
and drink some butterbeer?

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.603
-Ew!

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:18.437
-Do you know a bird just
[bleep] on your head?

00:02:18.437 --> 00:02:20.507
-Don't worry 'bout all that,
girl.

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:23.042
-Yo, she got jokes!
-I know, right?

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:25.111
-Is that a tail?

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:28.081
-It might be!
-A tail?!

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:29.582
-I'm trying to take you camping.

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:33.653
-Exactly, my man
just trying to take you --

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:34.654
-Oh, my God!

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:36.522
Your friend just got hit
by a car.

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:39.358
-Don't worry about all that.
I can't get a hug, though?

00:02:39.358 --> 00:02:40.760
-Okay, girl, let's just get
out of here.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.195
-Yep.

00:02:43.195 --> 00:02:44.831
[ Engine starts ]

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:46.699
-[ Groans ]

00:02:47.533 --> 00:02:51.437
-Man, they was ugly, anyway.

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:53.739
Let's get out of here, man.

00:02:53.739 --> 00:02:56.242
-They was busted!

